        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes the most important materials used for production. Also included is the transport of these materials and the energy needed for production.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
